<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>k3s is running — {{ inventory_hostname }}</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; background: #f4f6f8; color: #1f2933; }
    main { max-width: 42rem; margin: 4rem auto; padding: 2rem 2.5rem; background: #fff;
           border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, .1); }
    h1 { margin-top: 0; color: #0b7a3e; }
    code { background: #eef1f4; padding: .1rem .3rem; border-radius: 3px; }
    .flow { font-family: monospace; background: #eef1f4; padding: .8rem 1rem; border-radius: 4px; }
    footer { margin-top: 2rem; font-size: .85rem; color: #616e7c; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>k3s is running</h1>
    <p>This is the Ansible-autobott sample page on <strong>{{ inventory_hostname }}</strong>.</p>
    <p>You reached it through the cluster ingress:</p>
    <p class="flow">Traefik &rarr; Service <code>sample</code> &rarr; nginx pod</p>
    <p>The nginx pod runs in the <code>autobott-sample</code> namespace and serves this page from the
      ConfigMap <code>sample-content</code>.</p>
    <p>Its Ingress has no host and the lowest priority, so it answers every request that no other
      Ingress matches. Add an Ingress for your own app, or set <code>k3s.sample_content: false</code>
      to remove this page.</p>
    <footer>k3s {{ k3s_config.version }}</footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
